  "source_pdf": "downloads/nezhas-shape-town-v2.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "563057fea946cfc36b8e08974408a092a1baec410964b8eb5ca0dc445b440cc3",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5e1f6fc60de7bef743e9bb11026d9826fcf242b9b5480b12c30e9b2e3dc17b30",
      "text": "Nezha’s\nShape Town",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "34cdef1ddb33beaee240ff8058cf78ecc566c72fc317a22676d4e85d5e09ca5f",
      "text": "Nezha makes a paper town\non the floor.\nRed houses, green trees,\na long yellow road…\n“My town needs windows!”\n2",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "0fea377758963ef320254977aa9877fdac7a2239c3c582f11ca6a90b8629c977",
      "text": "Each house gets\na square window.\nBut the blue house has none.\nNezha looks in the box.\n3",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b6f97f532d3bf2da1deb3e27789adb912ce39bd9a33742dba6674ca1e64fd554",
      "text": "No more squares!\nOnly two blue triangles,\nthe same shape and size.\n“Two triangles\nare not a square,”\nsighs Nezha.\n4",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b7432bd20e21804f5c6bda785c8346c17d8c8d4c8d9299db387551feb2a2c328",
      "text": "Wukong puts them\non his head.\n“Look! My triangle hat\nhas two pointy corners!”\n5",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "1864ea100f07df831c0416d2505e05af9229506a818db11ce2845d0e34f0a696",
      "text": "Rabbit laughs.\n“Let’s turn them\nand try,” she says.\nShe turns one triangle.\n6",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "decb5c7f5f55e25d8035ca97dd556c44dabc7cd072becd9b7c6cba134d978a20",
      "text": "“When we turn\nthe triangles,\nthe long sides fit.”\nShe pushes them together.\n7",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "711a15886cee715f284c4ae9911ad5b5fdfdb1d38173160cc80b51c84ae0ed72",
      "text": "Four corners.\nFour sides, all the same.\n“A square!” shouts Nezha.\n8",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "7fbabb2f15a6b9c97f0ed2c51c482d0cceb658b7aaa3aff5d06614adfc8a449b",
      "text": "Nezha holds the square\nup to the blue house.\nIt fits just right!\n9",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "6b6fd26b3d10fcd1cb9b136b2ace00a480b71a6b99cc21a720178ebf249d7246",
      "text": "“Wait! Let me try,”\nsays Wukong.\nHe turns them a new way.\nNow the short sides fit.\n“A big triangle!”\n10",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "6d5cfc30da86f10c627f99d1ac6f9d2ecccf7ce45ce10f88d399df93ba22be55",
      "text": "Nezha puts it\non top of a house.\n“It looks like\na pointy roof!”\n11",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "7d8025fd53e55e4364715782a8bfadc3207c91a9cdf9bf6a34add023de850105",
      "text": "Rabbit counts the corners.\nThe square has four.\nThe triangle has three.\n“Same two pieces,\ndifferent shapes!”\n12",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "29367e7f3cc13144164bf55c516026e6e7183bd3d2a8fcfd030212166608b086",
      "text": "But the blue house\nstill needs a window.\nThey put the pieces\nback together: a square!\n13",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "4ba13792374bb4b15635fc1223cf6ed0b1e452400ba51adb1f4e23731496e700",
      "text": "Nezha sticks the window\non the blue house.\nEvery house has a window.\nThe town is ready!\n14",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d49887afa186d77ecbcc2c0c5f5214eec9947fe50f3828012a26371b6b95a231",
      "text": "Little toy friends\nwalk down the yellow road.\nThey peek in\nthe new window.\n15",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "0db99c7fd4b9085b3515e5e96a0c9aefb534edbd6e8276567587256fe661a075",
      "text": "Wukong pats his head.\n“Hey! My triangle hat\nbecame a window!”\nEveryone laughs.\n16",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "cc57f9806e9e3bcd4ddbc32e908cb2e12b574361756d6b487aac96bfbe18d08e",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\nThank you for reading!\nWe hope you and your little reader\nenjoyed this little adventure.\nMore free stories\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends\nRead, download and print - always free.\nRead more free stories\nIf you enjoyed our stories, you are welcome\nto help the next one grow. Support is optional.\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nCreated by Peihong Guo\nStories and illustrations made with AI assistance and human editing.\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · Attribution · NonCommercial · NoDerivatives\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
